{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>וַתֵּט</b> — Three times in the Masorah in this matter: two and one: וַתֵּט אָשׁוּרְנוּ מְנִי אָרְחָךְ. Why וַתֵּט הָאָתוֹן? On account of וַתֵּט אָשׁוּרְנוּ — that Balaam turned aside from the path, for he sought to curse them, and the Holy One, blessed be He, wished to bless them."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:52.416197756Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}